# Build artifacts directly under solver/ only. These MUST stay anchored with a
# leading "/": an unanchored pattern such as `solver` or `Makefile` also matches
# paths inside the vendored z3 fork (solver/fuzzy-sat/fuzzolic-z3/src/solver/,
# .../contrib/qprofdiff/Makefile) and silently drops those sources from git.
/solver
/CMakeCache.txt
/CMakeFiles
/cmake_install.cmake
/Makefile
/test.c
/.env
/.cache
